, friendships, and intertwined destinies manifesting during the everyday commute.","steam_appid":1267070,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://discord.gg/nz3EKpYScw"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Italian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"http://www.stelexsoftware.com"}